  "name": "distilled",
  "description": "Finds and uses distilled (distilled.cloud), the Effect-native TypeScript SDKs published as @distilled.cloud/* packages for AWS, Cloudflare, GCP, Azure, Stripe, GitHub, Neon, Supabase, Slack, Sentry, PostHog and about 90 other APIs. Use in an Effect v4 project when it calls a third-party or cloud API, when asked \"do we have a library for X\", \"is there an Effect SDK for X\", or before installing an upstream SDK such as stripe or @aws-sdk/*. Also for wiring a distilled package's layers, typed errors, pagination and retries. Not for building, patching or regenerating a distilled SDK itself (distilled-sdk, distilled-sdk-patch and distilled-sdk-update, which ship inside the alchemy-run/distilled repo).",
